{"title": "Knock Knuckle Gloves", "pageid": 10986, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Knock_Knuckle_Gloves", "categories": ["Gloves", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/2/27/Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Knock Knuckle Gloves image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Gloves_Leather_2_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Knock Knuckle Gloves</span></a> are an uncommon pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a> that grant the <a href=\"/wiki/Knock\" title=\"Knock\">Knock</a> spell and increase <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> by 1.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>In the palm of the left glove is a glossy scarlet solution that coats Thieves' Tools, making them more reliable. In the right, arcane symbols wax and wane.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" titl